{"type":"text","timestamp":1778872760703,"sessionID":"ses_1d2ee29dbffeDS6MAKCPHUbUS7","part":{"id":"prt_e2d142a18001C6BmgMERc0KR8A","messageID":"msg_e2d134cac001ZwoQSsZ732Xba9","sessionID":"ses_1d2ee29dbffeDS6MAKCPHUbUS7","type":"text","text":"This stays narrower than the failed late-store-data ideas: no new MEM forwarding lane, no store-slot plumbing, and no fetch prediction. It only fixes the current “raw instruction field aliases create fake dependencies” behavior, and it does it at the point where RVFI source fields are born.","time":{"start":1778872756760,"end":1778872760702},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0fcac26c856c34ef016a0771b49c508198aa52a7e045f9bb34","phase":"commentary"}}}}
