{"type":"text","timestamp":1778835265242,"sessionID":"ses_1d52925c1ffeNMU0NKEnVRJtki","part":{"id":"prt_e2ad809c9001kDDkwogeQXAfCu","messageID":"msg_e2ad7ac62001vxQzeTBD22hVr7","sessionID":"ses_1d52925c1ffeNMU0NKEnVRJtki","type":"text","text":"I’ve narrowed the best bench-specific angle to the same pre-freeze bottleneck that later helped `v1`: take cold `DIV/REM` off the universal one-cycle ALU path. I’m checking the local test inventory so the hypothesis names concrete touched files.","time":{"start":1778835261897,"end":1778835265241},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_012153fbb92fba74016a06df3da6e08198886df6766d915f60","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778835265269,"sessionID":"ses_1d52925c1ffeNMU0NKEnVRJtki","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"glob","callID":"call_pUHQYygOrTJv2zQ8z6nL0Tw4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"cores/bench/test/test_*.py","path":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3"},"output":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/test/test_reg_file.py\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/test/test_imm_gen.py\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/test/test_decoder.py\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/test/test_alu.py","metadata":{"count":5,"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1778835265246,"end":1778835265268}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_012153fbb92fba74016a06df4126b08198aaa0db944920be97"}},"id":"prt_e2ad816da001puFtejoQJaJXKY","sessionID":"ses_1d52925c1ffeNMU0NKEnVRJtki","messageID":"msg_e2ad7ac62001vxQzeTBD22hVr7"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778835265409,"sessionID":"ses_1d52925c1ffeNMU0NKEnVRJtki","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_8ktsryssACgAbaOHFScpWB4e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/core.yaml","offset":1,"limit":80},"output":"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/core.yaml</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: name: bench\n2: description: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\n3:   freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\n4:   and operates only on this directory.\n5: isa: rv32im\n6: nret: 1\n7: target_fpga: tang-nano-20k\n8: targets:\n9:   fmax_mhz: 135\n10:   lut4: 10000\n11:   coremark_iter_s: 300\n12:   coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\n13: current:\n14:   fmax_mhz: 127.03\n15:   lut4: 9563\n16:   ff: 1866\n17:   coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\n18:   coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\n19:   source_id: baseline-bench-2c63e03\n20:   updated: '2026-05-15T08:53:02.274483Z'\n\n(End of file - total 20 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"name: bench\ndescription: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\n  freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\n  and operates only on this directory.\nisa: rv32im\nnret: 1\ntarget_fpga: tang-nano-20k\ntargets:\n  fmax_mhz: 135\n  lut4: 10000\n  coremark_iter_s: 300\n  coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\ncurrent:\n  fmax_mhz: 127.03\n  lut4: 9563\n  ff: 1866\n  coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\n  coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\n  source_id: baseline-bench-2c63e03\n  updated: '2026-05-15T08:53:02.274483Z'","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"cores/bench/core.yaml","time":{"start":1778835265403,"end":1778835265408}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_012153fbb92fba74016a06df4126c08198a313a6870a645984"}},"id":"prt_e2ad816e90