{"type":"text","timestamp":1778836877604,"sessionID":"ses_1d511137cffe4v017SuI15LgTU","part":{"id":"prt_e2af0a6ae001leLVKdNkO1jyDV","messageID":"msg_e2af076d90014mb8IaE75oeUHB","sessionID":"ses_1d511137cffe4v017SuI15LgTU","type":"text","text":"The best-supported angle is the `RTL-only hot/cold ALU opcode split`: it was a measured improvement in `v1`, while the alternative hazard-source qualification later regressed badly. I’m checking the local test surface so the hypothesis can name the smallest realistic file set.","time":{"start":1778836874926,"end":1778836877603},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0251f3563ddde6ca016a06e58ad2e8819b8fe4a464f729fd75","phase":"commentary"}}}}
