{"type":"text","timestamp":1778836910183,"sessionID":"ses_1d511137cffe4v017SuI15LgTU","part":{"id":"prt_e2af0fb9300142Rly7mgglPY53","messageID":"msg_e2af0cf14001R8366jxBzz52AX","sessionID":"ses_1d511137cffe4v017SuI15LgTU","type":"text","text":"I have enough context. I’m writing a `micro_opt` hypothesis that ports the proven `v1` ALU hot/cold mux split into `cores/bench`, with a deliberately small file set and no control-flow or memory-side changes.","time":{"start":1778836896659,"end":1778836910182},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_030e44d74e8fba0d016a06e5a08060819b806ad5573998edc7","phase":"commentary"}}}}
