{"type":"text","timestamp":1778855986683,"sessionID":"ses_1d3eea616ffepryMqag26cfmrq","part":{"id":"prt_e2c1445f1001Vi401N85wN5yO4","messageID":"msg_e2c13fcd8001zxDlLOy4aV7etg","sessionID":"ses_1d3eea616ffepryMqag26cfmrq","type":"text","text":"I narrowed the idea further to avoid repeating the broken r4s0 broad interlock: this hypothesis only removes the load-to-store-data bubble, with explicit RVFI/store-slot canonicalization in MEM. Writing that schema-valid YAML now.","time":{"start":1778855986674,"end":1778855986679},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_089afcba0e6455c0016a07303254c4819abaa37b4a4bc8e4a5","phase":"commentary"}}}}
