{"type":"text","timestamp":1778871042444,"sessionID":"ses_1d3082364ffeSUTMfN6QLwgtRN","part":{"id":"prt_e2cfa00db001piaQRE0gyB7pzl","messageID":"msg_e2cf9cf30001z8mZUlp0aPDv0k","sessionID":"ses_1d3082364ffeSUTMfN6QLwgtRN","type":"text","text":"I’ve picked the hypothesis: replace the current three parallel MUL-family products with one shared sign-configurable multiplier in `alu.sv`. It stays off the fragile fetch/store-control paths that regressed, preserves IPC, and directly targets a localized EX datapath cost that the current RTL still carries every cycle.","time":{"start":1778871042267,"end":1778871042443},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0e22ce4747dbe3cf016a076b02271c8198bebf3f40197b766c","phase":"commentary"}}}}
