{"type":"text","timestamp":1778874600342,"sessionID":"ses_1d2d0d3c9ffeSQE1aIf1BCjWph","part":{"id":"prt_e2d304902001ZCw5oayNIzUkHu","messageID":"msg_e2d302a17001cp0etOT0RVjvx5","sessionID":"ses_1d2d0d3c9ffeSQE1aIf1BCjWph","type":"text","text":"I have the angle: add a separate decode-owned source-liveness sideband for hazard detection so load-use stalls are based on true EX-time consumers, while RVFI keeps the raw architectural source fields unchanged. I’m writing that as the structural hypothesis file now.","time":{"start":1778874599682,"end":1778874600342},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0fb93de7fb59f8d3016a0778e7870c81998246dc13edcb522a","phase":"commentary"}}}}
