{"type":"text","timestamp":1778836848145,"sessionID":"ses_1d51113c0ffengOn9ellsHEzV4","part":{"id":"prt_e2af035ff001YegEI58CH5oKpB","messageID":"msg_e2aeff2f0001gIj3EGtIEJg6Dm","sessionID":"ses_1d51113c0ffengOn9ellsHEzV4","type":"text","text":"I’ve narrowed it to a store-side decoupling hypothesis: it matches the current bench bottleneck profile and avoids the fetch-path regression pattern from the failed branch-side attempt. I’m checking the local test file names so the hypothesis can point at realistic validation targets.","time":{"start":1778836846079,"end":1778836848144},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00cae1cd4ae160fb016a06e56dfd4c819abb09d7f40d9064bd","phase":"commentary"}}}}
