tle\\\": \\\"MEM-to-EX Load-Use Bypass\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"structural\\\", \\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current five-stage pipeline still has the textbook structural load-use gap: a load in EX always forces the immediately following consumer to wait one extra cycle, even when the dmem bus is ready and the loaded word is already available combinationally in MEM. CoreMark's list, matrix, and state kernels contain many load-to-use pairs, so this fixed bubble directly lowers iterations per cycle. The recent predictor win improved control flow without changing the backend; the next most promising structural angle is to add the missing MEM-to-EX load-data path and remove the mandatory interlock while preserving the single-issue in-order retirement contract.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": {\\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current five-stage pipeline still has the textbook structural load-use gap: a load in EX always forces the immediately following consumer to wait one extra cycle, even when the dmem bus is ready and the loaded word is already available combinationally in MEM. CoreMark's list, matrix, and state kernels contain many load-to-use pairs, so this fixed bubble directly lowers iterations per cycle. The recent predictor win improved control flow without changing the backend; the next most promising structural angle is to add the missing MEM-to-EX load-data path and remove the mandatory ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n16: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778853938498,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf73fffeu3RU5Gf0kIKttG\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"grep\",\"callID\":\"call_bBoX9y2P28xM8THTCUNKHr3P\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"store data|late load-store|load-to-store|store-data forwarding|Forward load data to stores|rs2-only\",\"path\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3\",\"include\":\"*.md\"},\"output\":\"No files found\",\"metadata\":{\"matches\":0,\"truncated\":false}