\\": \\\"Static BTFNT branch predictor with ID redirect\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"predictor\\\", \\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current bench core resolves every branch and jump in EX and flushes on every taken redirect. CoreMark is loop-heavy, so repeatedly paying that taken-branch penalty burns IPC. LUT headroom is tight, which makes a low-state predictor more attractive than a larger dynamic structure.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": {\\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current bench core resolves every branch and jump in EX and flushes on every taken redirect. CoreMark is loop-heavy, so repeatedly paying that taken-branch penalty burns IPC. LUT headroom is tight, which makes a low-state predictor more attractive than a larger dynamic structure.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"Add a decode-stage backward-taken/forward-not-taken predictor for conditional branches and always predict JAL taken, driving a speculative next PC from ID into IF. EX remains the architectural source of truth for branch direction and target, but only flushes and recovers on a mispredict. This should remove most loop-backedge and JAL bubbles in CoreMark while staying much lighter than a tagged BTB/BHT, limiting Fmax and LUT risk.\\\\n\\\", \\\"expected_impact\\\": {\\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\": 8, \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}, \\\"changes\\\": [{\\... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n9: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778872641512,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d2ee2971ffex1LvOdi7zqPOdc\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"grep\",\"callID\":\"call_9WcTL0nXk9M7N8MpK4ag2crO\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"\\\"category\\\": \\\"predictor\\\".*\\\"outcome\\\":|\\\"id\\\": \\\"hyp-20260515-003-r5s2\\\"|\\\"id\\\": \\\"hyp-20260515-003-r6s2\\\"\",\"path\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/experiments\",\"include\":\"log.jsonl\"},\"output\":\"Found 9 matches\\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/be