{"type":"text","timestamp":1778879587521,"sessionID":"ses_1d2863275ffecU7AoS7MPyx9nI","part":{"id":"prt_e2d7c611d001ohXGKfozmgwFMX","messageID":"msg_e2d7c4958001h3m3AmCcwpVJf5","sessionID":"ses_1d2863275ffecU7AoS7MPyx9nI","type":"text","text":"Wrote `cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r14s2.yaml`.\n\nProposal summary: keep the only predictor shape that stayed timing-safe on `bench` (single-slot backedge fold/inject with sequential `io_imemAddr`) and improve only its EX-time replacement policy with a tiny sticky confidence counter so hot loops are not evicted immediately by colder backedges.","time":{"start":1778879586589,"end":1778879587520},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f74bdd8a0540807016a078c62723c81998daa34f0826fb3d1","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
