{"type":"text","timestamp":1778882334334,"sessionID":"ses_1d25b7dd1ffePyQ2UXCo1NepoO","part":{"id":"prt_e2da644c4001P3Q4RAq0dkNyax","messageID":"msg_e2da544360015dosIAIpqu44JF","sessionID":"ses_1d25b7dd1ffePyQ2UXCo1NepoO","type":"text","text":"I found a cleaner remaining angle: use prediction only after EX has already decided to redirect, caching the first target instruction so a repeated taken branch or JAL can inject the real target word immediately without any live fetch-path lookup or fold-sideband plumbing.","time":{"start":1778882331844,"end":1778882334332},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f8eb7836d45071b016a07971bac348199ba98645782fd71f7","phase":"commentary"}}}}
