{"type":"text","timestamp":1778836917926,"sessionID":"ses_1d5111418ffeMqrGFIyxKLZkLg","part":{"id":"prt_e2af14a14001TAx0TVSx81Kurg","messageID":"msg_e2af13a740011xEnpzyvFEXil3","sessionID":"ses_1d5111418ffeMqrGFIyxKLZkLg","type":"text","text":"The hypothesis is converging on a replay-style fetch predictor, not another branch-direction table: bench’s own lesson says current-cycle branch target generation hurts Fmax, while the broader core history shows the best predictor gains came from registered instruction replay that hides random `imemReady` stalls. I’m writing that as a bench-specific proposal now.","time":{"start":1778836916756,"end":1778836917923},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_081812ba57c26d61016a06e5b4a8e48198a3728d464ce551e8","phase":"commentary"}}}}
