{"type":"text","timestamp":1778853954627,"sessionID":"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu","part":{"id":"prt_e2bf536a40010jgV8SL9dWMQoz","messageID":"msg_e2bf4944a001GLv5HJP3fYuZlV","sessionID":"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu","type":"text","text":"I found the prior failures clustered around two bad patterns: same-cycle ID target generation and fetch-side tagged lookup. The remaining predictor that still looks plausible is a minimal loop predictor that reuses EX-trained targets and only speculates on the hottest backward branch, so the hardware stays closer to a single registered slot than to a BTB.","time":{"start":1778853951140,"end":1778853954624},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00bf0a5c8f258675016a07283eed408199b41083697d187678","phase":"commentary"}}}}
