{"type":"text","timestamp":1778855983947,"sessionID":"ses_1d3eea769ffeUJxlp1l32Pe8MA","part":{"id":"prt_e2c1432a2001L6yGVZcruF0m19","messageID":"msg_e2c142251001YB5I4T0FN2MSTb","sessionID":"ses_1d3eea769ffeUJxlp1l32Pe8MA","type":"text","text":"I have the file location. Writing a predictor hypothesis centered on one-entry branch folding: cache the target instruction for a hot taken backedge, fold it into decode, and keep the PC repair in EX so `imemAddr` timing stays mostly untouched.","time":{"start":1778855981730,"end":1778855983940},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_08e0cd8e04dc954d016a07302d9550819bacc9b62b794c58a2","phase":"commentary"}}}}
