o repeatedly paying that taken-branch penalty burns IPC. LUT headroom is tight, which makes a low-state predictor more attractive than a larger dynamic structure.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": {\\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current bench core resolves every branch and jump in EX and flushes on every taken redirect. CoreMark is loop-heavy, so repeatedly paying that taken-branch penalty burns IPC. LUT headroom is tight, which makes a low-state predictor more attractive than a larger dynamic structure.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"Add a decode-stage backward-taken/forward-not-taken predictor for conditional branches and always predict JAL taken, driving a speculative next PC from ID into IF. EX remains the architectural source of truth for branch direction and target, but only flushes and recovers on a mispredict. This should remove most loop-backedge and JAL bubbles in CoreMark while staying much lighter than a tagged BTB/BHT, limiting Fmax and LUT risk.\\\\n\\\", \\\"expected_impact\\\": {\\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\": 8, \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}, \\\"changes\\\": [{\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/core.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Wire an ID-stage prediction path into IF and route EX-stage misp... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1778853899337,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2bf46c48001WGyB0P5sYqOL2l\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"9a619dfd69c68205dabe2c22ba0b6720c15f89c3\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2bf45236001oi5XUc5TDWoBJj\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":44955,\"input\":4261,\"output\":218,\"reasoning\":28,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":40448}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778853900644,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2bf47163001NiazsdmVTXns4Q\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2bf46c9a001VfmplRYRnHUr2I\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"snapshot\":\"9a619dfd69c68205dabe2c22ba0b6720c15f89c3\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1778853909358,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2bf48ac9001ek8kUo2p2NqcLB\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2bf46c9a001VfmplRYRnHUr2I\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The viable predictor space here looks narrower: improve control-flow accuracy without adding same-cycle decode, tag-compare, or target mux depth to `if_stage`’s `pc -> next_pc` cone. I’m checking the hypothesis directory and then writing a predictor that keeps prediction state registered in EX/ID metadata instead of fetch-side lookup.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778853907145,\"end\":1778853909356},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_0c21b767545eb322016a0728131214819a843c736bc25b73f7\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778853909371,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_nF86IjAhL3BuASvOHZXxwGZn\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":200},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses</path>\\n<type>directory</type>\\n<entries>\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-001-r2s0.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-001-r3s0.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-001-r4s0.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-002-r1s1.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-002-r2s1.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-002-r3s1.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-002-r4s1.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r1s2.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r2s2.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r3s2.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r4s2.log\\n\\n(12 entries)\\n</entries>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\".agent.hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.log\\n.agent.hyp-20260515-001-r2s