he highest-leverage micro-opt still missing\\\\nfrom the frozen bench fixture: it targets Fmax directly while preserving the\\\\nhot one-cycle behavior for the instructions that dominate CoreMark.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": {\\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The frozen bench core still keeps DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU in the same\\\\ncombinational ALU path as ADD, address generation, branch support, and\\\\nMUL. On a Tang Nano 20K, a full 32-bit divider is a strong candidate for\\\\nthe universal EX-stage critical path, yet CoreMark's timed loop is mostly\\\\nmultiply, load/store, and branch traffic and should pay little or no steady\\\\nstate penalty from slower divide instructions.\\\\n\\\\nThis makes divider extraction the highest-leverage micro-opt still missing\\\\nfrom the frozen bench fixture: it targets Fmax directly while preserving the\\\\nhot one-cycle behavior ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1778853909486,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2bf493ed001DTf1MBQUAqLFP3\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"9a619dfd69c68205dabe2c22ba0b6720c15f89c3\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2bf46c9a001VfmplRYRnHUr2I\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":51844,\"input\":6859,\"output\":242,\"reasoning\":199,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":44544}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778853910446,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2bf497ad0017QztDLxAVY7c1k\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2bf4944a001GLv5HJP3fYuZlV\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"snapshot\":\"9a619dfd69c68205dabe2c22ba0b6720c15f89c3\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1778853954627,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2bf536a40010jgV8SL9dWMQoz\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2bf4944a001GLv5HJP3fYuZlV\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I found the prior failures clustered around two bad patterns: same-cycle ID target generation and fetch-side tagged lookup. The remaining predictor that still looks plausible is a minimal loop predictor that reuses EX-trained targets and only speculates on the hottest backward branch, so the hardware stays closer to a single registered slot than to a BTB.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778853951140,\"end\":1778853954624},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_00bf0a5c8f258675016a07283eed408199b41083697d187678\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778853954714,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_HDJjxyau2HfTwSPkS4H6V0EZ\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/test\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":200},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep3/cores/bench/test</path>\\n<type>directory</type>\\n<entries>\\n_helpers.py\\nconftest.py\\ntest_alu.py\\ntest_decoder.py\\ntest_div_unit.py\\ntest_imm_gen.py\\ntest_pipeline.py\\ntest_reg_file.py\\n\\n(8 entries)\\n</entries>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"_helpers.py\\nconftest.py\\ntest_alu.py\\ntest_decoder.py\\ntest_div_unit.py\\ntest_imm_gen.py\\ntest_pipeline.py\\ntest_reg_file.py\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[]},\"title\":\"cores/bench/test\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778853954706,\"end\":1778853954714}},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"fc_00bf0a5c8f258675016a07284284d48199b37605ac825fb501\"}},\"id\":\"prt_e2bf54444001EG33i665MoNwaK\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2bf4944a001GLv5HJP3fYuZlV\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778853954755,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d40bf6c8ffeOZq3R6p3F3gOVu\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_oKrZW5Of0PoDLJyqAeCXRcgr\",\"state\":{\"status